{"4516370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "It Breathes", "steam_appid": 4516370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get out!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a musty room. You don't know how you got here or who you are; you have no memories. You only know one thing: you have to escape. And the mysterious monster on the TV in front of you says he will help you do that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516370/extras/f795e06f62a5a18f6fd3614b406112a8.poster.avif?t=1774373459\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516370/extras/f795e06f62a5a18f6fd3614b406112a8.webm?t=1774373459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516370/extras/f795e06f62a5a18f6fd3614b406112a8.mp4?t=1774373459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prove yourself!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hercegh Hospital is full of twisted puzzles and Its creations. Overcome the obstacles to prove your worth. Only then can you earn your freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516370/extras/b3decaec82d335d1782bc391aaf99433.poster.avif?t=1774373459\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516370/extras/b3decaec82d335d1782bc391aaf99433.webm?t=1774373459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516370/extras/b3decaec82d335d1782bc391aaf99433.mp4?t=1774373459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover the buried history of the hospital!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out about Dr. Hercegh's horrific legacy and immerse yourself in the history of the hospital. It has been erased from history books and wiped from maps, but it's only a matter of time before the horrors within its walls escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516370/extras/89ff85a15ed17e4aca4f5b441c3448bb.poster.avif?t=1774373459\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516370/extras/89ff85a15ed17e4aca4f5b441c3448bb.webm?t=1774373459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516370/extras/89ff85a15ed17e4aca4f5b441c3448bb.mp4?t=1774373459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >If you see It, run!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't defeat It. It will find you and will kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516370/extras/7e2359b3c28b35448944dba329e95d5f.poster.avif?t=1774373459\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516370/extras/7e2359b3c28b35448944dba329e95d5f.webm?t=1774373459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516370/extras/7e2359b3c28b35448944dba329e95d5f.mp4?t=1774373459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get out!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a musty room. You don't know how you got here or who you are; you have no memories. You only know one thing: you have to escape. And the mysterious monster on the TV in front of you says he will help you do that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516370/extras/f795e06f62a5a18f6fd3614b406112a8.poster.avif?t=1774373459\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516370/extras/f795e06f62a5a18f6fd3614b406112a8.webm?t=1774373459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516370/extras/f795e06f62a5a18f6fd3614b406112a8.mp4?t=1774373459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prove yourself!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hercegh Hospital is full of twisted puzzles and Its creations. Overcome the obstacles to prove your worth. Only then can you earn your freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516370/extras/b3decaec82d335d1782bc391aaf99433.poster.avif?t=1774373459\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516370/extras/b3decaec82d335d1782bc391aaf99433.webm?t=1774373459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516370/extras/b3decaec82d335d1782bc391aaf99433.mp4?t=1774373459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover the buried history of the hospital!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out about Dr. Hercegh's horrific legacy and immerse yourself in the history of the hospital. It has been erased from history books and wiped from maps, but it's only a matter of time before the horrors within its walls escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516370/extras/89ff85a15ed17e4aca4f5b441c3448bb.poster.avif?t=1774373459\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516370/extras/89ff85a15ed17e4aca4f5b441c3448bb.webm?t=1774373459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516370/extras/89ff85a15ed17e4aca4f5b441c3448bb.mp4?t=1774373459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >If you see It, run!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't defeat It. It will find you and will kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516370/extras/7e2359b3c28b35448944dba329e95d5f.poster.avif?t=1774373459\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516370/extras/7e2359b3c28b35448944dba329e95d5f.webm?t=1774373459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516370/extras/7e2359b3c28b35448944dba329e95d5f.mp4?t=1774373459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "First-person VHS horror game set in an abandoned Hungarian hospital. Hide, fight, or flee while working towards your only goal: to escape.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Hungarian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4516370/38496af45e8301d78127610b30bfd5398e8833d1/header.jpg?t=1774373459